  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Caritas Norway Cuba Programme 2025 &#x2013; 2028</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project &#xab;Dialogue for Political Reform in Cuba&#xbb; was initiated in 2013 and has been supported by MFA since then. The objective of this project is to contribute to the reform efforts in Cuba by facilitating constructive dialogue between civil society and the government, and provide key youth leaders knowledge on democratic theory and human rights.</narrative>
  </description>
